*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0008
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-07-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 801
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0008.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCT-TYP           PIC X.
    *> TRANSACTIONS THIS MONTH
    05 TXN-COUNT-MTH      PIC 9(3).
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 EXTRA-TXN-FEE      PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM EXCESS-TXN-FEE
    PERFORM 3100-BUS-SURCHG
    DISPLAY "EXTRA-TXN-FEE=" EXTRA-TXN-FEE
    STOP RUN.
EXCESS-TXN-FEE.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    IF TXN-COUNT-MTH > 15
        COMPUTE EXTRA-TXN-FEE ROUNDED = (TXN-COUNT-MTH - 15) * 0.75
    END-IF.
3100-BUS-SURCHG.
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'B' AND TXN-COUNT-MTH > 45
        ADD 15 TO EXTRA-TXN-FEE
    END-IF.
